--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code included in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/rapick/picker/overlay/ contains modified copies of three files from
CryoTransformer, which is MIT-licensed:

    CryoTransformer  (c) 2023 Jianlin Cheng
    https://github.com/jianlin-cheng/CryoTransformer

    predict.py, train.py and datasets/micrograph.py are modified; the change
    against the pinned upstream commit is recorded in
    src/rapick/picker/patches/. Every other file of CryoTransformer is fetched
    from upstream by scripts/setup.sh and is not redistributed here.

Every other third-party work this project depends on is fetched at setup time
and is not redistributed. See docs/BASELINES.md and repos.lock.yaml for the
pinned commits and their licenses.
